        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukumona kaŋelu waŋovu mukwawu hakusuluka kwiwulu, navwali ivu, nikasuluŋunda kadi kunamutu windi; kumesu indi kudi neyi itaŋwa; ninyendu yindi yidi neyi yishimi yakesi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muchikasa chindi mudi kamukanda kanyanya kakubakula dehi. Hakusha mwendu windi wachidiilu hakaluŋalwiji, mwendu windi wachimunswa heseki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakubidika nezu datiyakana neyi chabulumaŋa mutupa. Chanabidikiyi yivumina yitanu nayiyedi yivuma nikuvuma. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Chiyinavumi yivumina yitanu nayiyedi, hinukwila nami nisoneki, hinukutiya izu kwiwulu hidikwila nindi, Lamikaku yuma yinahoshi yivuminoyu yitanu nayiyedi nayilamiki, bayi wuyisonekaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaŋelu namweni nakwimana hakaluŋalwiji niheseki, hakwolola chikasa chindi chachidiilu kwiwulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakusanyika wahandaŋa haya nyaka nanyaka, waleŋeli iwulu niyuma yekalamu, niiseki niyuma yekalamu, nikaluŋalwiji niyuma yekalamu, nindi hiyakalaba nawaku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ilaŋa mumafuku ezu dakaŋelu wamu chitanu nachiyedi hakakeŋa kwimbilayi, dihu hakamana Nsaŋu yaNzambi yakujinda, mwashimwiniyi nsaŋu yayiwahi kudi ambuŋindi atuprofwetu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Izu odu dinatiyili kwiwulu hinukuditiya cheŋi, hidikuhosha nanami nindi, Yaku wutambuli mukanda wakubakula wudi muchikasa chakaŋelu nemani hakaluŋalwiji niheseki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukuya kudi kaŋelu, hinukumwila nami, Anyinki kamukandaka. Yena hakuŋila nindi, Tambulaku wukidyi kejima; kakululisha mwivumu deyi ilaŋa mukanwa keyi kakutowala neyi wuchi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hinukutambula kamukandoku kuchikasa chakaŋelu, hinukukidya kejima. Mukanwa kami himukutowala neyi wuchi; chinadyi to, mwivumu mulula nikulula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hiyakuŋila nawu, chiŋa wakaprofwetelaŋa cheŋi antu amavulu ninyuza yayivulu niakwamadimi amavulu nianyanta ankanu amavulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.10.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
